# Keeps this collection folder in git even while it holds no notes.
#
# Astro binds each collection's file watcher to its base directory when the dev
# server starts. A folder created later — by the sync script's `mkdir -p` — is
# never picked up, so notes synced into it stay invisible until the server is
# restarted. Committing the folder means it always exists, and the watcher
# always has something to bind to.
#
# The collections are declared in src/content.config.ts.
